docs(openspec): propose the English-vocabulary migration for openconnector

Implements the fleet policy in hydra/openspec/changes/fleet-english-vocabulary:
English identifiers with no Dutch-origin exemption, concepts internationalised
rather than transliterated (btw->vat, kvk->companyRegistrationNumber,
bsn->nationalIdentityNumber), Dutch moved to app-level l10n, and an
x-statutory-basis marker where a concept is NL law with no counterpart.

Proposal only — no code changes. The cross-app words this app shares with
others (case/caseId, decision, customer) are ratified in the fleet change's
design.md and may not be diverged from here.
